# Scenario 04 — semlayer.ttl MANIFEST drives shape selection.
# When semlayer.ttl is present it is authoritative: only the shape files it names
# via sh:shapesGraph are used, and the conventions (root shapes.ttl, shapes/ dir)
# are NOT applied. This repo includes a DECOY root shapes.ttl that must be
# IGNORED — if it were wrongly applied, the good ABox would fail.

@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://example.org/health#> .

<https://example.org/health> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Health model (manifest-driven shapes)" .

ex:Patient a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "Patient" .
